  unitName: Skilled Lance Noah
  unitId: 20495
  unitNumber: 779
  description: A mock Unit modeled after Noah, a Summoner of the Regular Army. A
    Summoner from whom many great things were expected of, and of so much raw talent
    and potential that his greatness was acknowledged by all. It is rumored that
    he received the divine protection of a powerful water spirit as a child, but
    he has no recollection of this. Now he lives with his heart shut to all those
    around him, continuing to grow independently of others. Will he be able to release
    his true power living this way?
  summonDesc: I can't deny your ability.<br>But I'll only get even stronger.<br>Not
    for my past, but for the future.
  fusionDesc: "Hmph, fine. I don't care.<br>As long as it makes me stronger.<br>I
    should thank you...I guess\u2026"
  evoDesc: How ironic.<br>To think that my partner this time<br>would make me stronger
    instead.
  element: 2
  rarity: 5
